    "NDA is a SERVICES exam, not a State-Board-derived one, and it is the first of",
    "the three where the State Board genuinely falls short. Its General Ability",
    "paper draws on Class 9/10 general science and on plain general awareness -",
    "simple machines, the human eye, SONAR, scientific acronyms, who discovered",
    "what - none of which the Std XI/XII books teach, because they are not Std",
    "XI/XII material.",
    "",
    "That is what a `not` means here: NOT IN THESE TWO BOOKS. Several of these",
    "topics ARE in the Maharashtra Class 9/10 science books, which this map does",
    "not yet carry a spine for. Read a gap as 'your Std XI/XII student has not met",
    "this here', not as 'nobody teaches it'.",
    "",
    "Every ruling cites the section that teaches it, checked against book TEXT via",
    "generated-papers/physics-corpus.json rather than against section titles."
  ],
